msgid "%1$s %2$s is available. You are running %3$s."
msgstr "%1$s %2$s er tilgængelig. Du kører %3$s."

#: build/admin.js:66
msgid "Update to get the latest fixes and compliance improvements."
msgstr "Opdater for at få de seneste rettelser og overholdelsesforbedringer."

#: build/admin.js:66
msgid "Update Now"
msgstr "Opdater nu"

#: build/admin.js:107
msgid "Fill up the parts you know: What your own forms collect, how long you keep it, and why you are allowed to."
msgstr "Udfyld de dele, du kender: Hvad dine egne formularer indsamler, hvor længe du gemmer det, og hvorfor du har lov til det."

#: build/admin.js:107
msgid "Keep the shortcodes. Those sections rewrite themselves when your cookie and consent settings change."
msgstr "Bevar shortcodes. Disse sektioner omskriver sig selv, når dine cookie- og samtykkeindstillinger ændres."

#: inc/functions/get.php:156
msgid "Measure how this site is used, such as which pages are viewed and where visitors arrive from. Also called reach measurement."
msgstr "Mål, hvordan dette websted bruges, såsom hvilke sider der bliver vist, og hvor besøgende kommer fra. Kaldes også rækkeviddemåling."

#: inc/functions/get.php:1385
#: build/admin.js:5
#: build/admin.js:69
msgid "Legal Notice"
msgstr "Juridisk meddelelse"

#: inc/integrations/site-health/consent-write.php:86
#: inc/integrations/site-health/consent-write.php:173
msgid "Consent log delivery"
msgstr "Levering af samtykkelog"

#: inc/integrations/site-health/consent-write.php:101
msgid "SureCookie is recording consent"
msgstr "SureCookie registrerer samtykke"

#: inc/integrations/site-health/consent-write.php:107
msgid "Consent writes reach WordPress, so every visitor decision is being added to your consent log."
msgstr "Samtykke skriver til rækkevidde WordPress, så hver besøgendes beslutning bliver tilføjet til din samtykkelog."

#: inc/integrations/site-health/consent-write.php:119
msgid "SureCookie is routing consent writes around your server"
msgstr "SureCookie dirigerer samtykkeskrivninger rundt om din server"

#: inc/integrations/site-health/consent-write.php:120
msgid "Something on your server answers the consent log address before WordPress sees it, which is usually a firewall rule protecting files whose names end in -log. Consent is still being recorded, because SureCookie retries each write on a second address, but every write now costs two requests."
msgstr "Noget på din server svarer på samtykkelog-adressen, før WordPress ser den, hvilket normalt er en firewallregel, der beskytter filer, hvis navne ender på -log. Samtykke bliver stadig registreret, fordi SureCookie prøver hver skrivning igen på en anden adresse, men hver skrivning koster nu to forespørgsler."

#: inc/integrations/site-health/consent-write.php:126
#: inc/integrations/site-health/consent-write.php:133
msgid "SureCookie cannot record consent"
msgstr "SureCookie kan ikke registrere samtykke"

#: inc/integrations/site-health/consent-write.php:127
msgid "Neither consent log address reaches WordPress, so visitor decisions are not being saved and your Consent Logs screen will stay empty. The requests are answered before WordPress loads, which is why nothing is reported anywhere else."
msgstr "Ingen af samtykkelog-adresserne når WordPress, så besøgendes beslutninger bliver ikke gemt, og din skærm for samtykkelogs forbliver tom. Forespørgslerne besvares, før WordPress indlæses, hvilket er grunden til, at intet rapporteres andre steder."

#: inc/integrations/site-health/consent-write.php:134
msgid "WordPress refuses the consent log address for visitors who are not logged in, so visitor decisions are not being saved and your Consent Logs screen will stay empty. A plugin or code snippet that restricts the REST API to logged-in users usually causes this."
msgstr "WordPress afviser samtykkelog-adressen for besøgende, der ikke er logget ind, så besøgendes beslutninger bliver ikke gemt, og din skærm for samtykkelogs forbliver tom. Et plugin eller kodeudsnit, der begrænser REST API til kun indloggede brugere, forårsager normalt dette."

#: inc/integrations/site-health/consent-write.php:135
msgid "Allow these REST API routes for visitors who are not logged in, in whatever restricts your REST API:"
msgstr "Tillad disse REST API-ruter for besøgende, der ikke er logget ind, i det, der begrænser din REST API:"

#: inc/integrations/site-health/consent-write.php:140
msgid "SureCookie could not check consent recording"
msgstr "SureCookie kunne ikke kontrollere samtykkeregistrering"

#: inc/integrations/site-health/consent-write.php:141
msgid "This site could not make a request to itself, so whether consent writes arrive is unknown. That usually means outgoing requests are blocked, and WordPress reports its own loopback failure separately."
msgstr "Dette websted kunne ikke sende en forespørgsel til sig selv, så om samtykkeskrivninger ankommer, er ukendt. Det betyder normalt, at udgående forespørgsler er blokeret, og WordPress rapporterer sin egen loopback-fejl separat."

#: inc/integrations/site-health/consent-write.php:163
msgid "Reaching WordPress"
msgstr "Forbinder til WordPress"

#: inc/integrations/site-health/consent-write.php:164
msgid "Blocked - retried on the query-string route"
msgstr "Blokeret - prøvet igen på forespørgselsstreng-ruten"

#: inc/integrations/site-health/consent-write.php:165
msgid "Blocked on both routes"
msgstr "Blokeret på begge ruter"

#: inc/integrations/site-health/consent-write.php:166
msgid "Refused by WordPress for logged-out visitors"
msgstr "Afvist af WordPress for besøgende, der ikke er logget ind"

#: inc/integrations/site-health/consent-write.php:167
msgid "Consent logging is turned off"
msgstr "Samtykkeregistrering er slået fra"

#: inc/integrations/site-health/consent-write.php:168
msgid "Could not be checked - no loopback"
msgstr "Kunne ikke kontrolleres - ingen loopback"

#: inc/integrations/site-health/consent-write.php:178
msgid "Consent writes rejected today (stale token)"
msgstr "Samtykkeskrivninger afvist i dag (forældet token)"

#: inc/integrations/site-health/consent-write.php:276
msgid "Ask your host to stop blocking this address. It is a WordPress REST route, not a log file, and the rule is matching it only because the address ends in -log:"
msgstr "Bed din vært om at stoppe med at blokere denne adresse. Det er en WordPress REST-rute, ikke en logfil, og reglen matcher kun, fordi adressen ender på -log:"

#: inc/modules/site-scanner/saas-client.php:1180
msgid "Scan finished."
msgstr "Scanning færdig."

#: inc/utils/localize-data.php:567
msgid "Pages"
msgstr "Sider"

#: inc/utils/settings-metadata.php:244
msgid "Post ID of the cookie policy page linked from the preferences modal. 0 means none is linked."
msgstr "Indlæggets ID for cookiepolitik-siden, der er linket fra præferencevinduet. 0 betyder, at ingen er linket."

#: inc/utils/settings-metadata.php:249
msgid "This is not WordPress's own wp_page_for_privacy_policy option. Writing it does not change the page WordPress links from the footer or the login screen, nor the one the consent modal links, which reads core's option first and falls back to this only when core has no published policy; use the \"Use as WordPress Privacy Policy page\" action to make them agree."
msgstr "Dette er ikke WordPress' egen wp_page_for_privacy_policy-indstilling. At skrive den ændrer ikke den side, WordPress linker til fra sidefoden eller login-skærmen, heller ikke den, som samtykkevinduet linker til, som først læser kerneindstillingen og kun falder tilbage til denne, når kernen ikke har en offentliggjort politik; brug handlingen \"Brug som WordPress Privacy Policy-side\" for at få dem til at stemme overens."

#: inc/utils/settings-metadata.php:252
msgid "Which legal links the preferences modal shows and in what order, as a comma-separated list of the tokens cookie_policy, privacy_policy and legal_notice. A token left out is hidden. An empty string hides all three."
msgstr "Hvilke juridiske links præferencevinduet viser, og i hvilken rækkefølge, som en kommasepareret liste over tokens cookie_policy, privacy_policy og legal_notice. Et udeladt token skjules. En tom streng skjuler alle tre."

#: inc/utils/settings-metadata.php:253
msgid "Hiding a link does not unpublish its page, but with the banner overlay on the consent UI is the only place a visitor can reach it."
msgstr "At skjule et link afpublicerer ikke siden, men med banneroverlayet på samtykke-UI'et er det det eneste sted, en besøgende kan nå det."

#: inc/utils/settings-metadata.php:256
msgid "Post ID of the legal notice / imprint (Impressum) page linked from the preferences modal. 0 means none is linked."
msgstr "Indlæggets ID for siden med juridisk meddelelse / imprint (Impressum), der linkes fra præferencevinduet. 0 betyder, at der ikke linkes til nogen."

#: inc/utils/settings-metadata.php:257
msgid "Sanitized with absint, so a non-numeric or negative value becomes 0 and silently unlinks a page several jurisdictions require to stay reachable."
msgstr "Renset med absint, så en ikke-numerisk eller negativ værdi bliver til 0 og stille fjerner linket til en side, som flere jurisdiktioner kræver forbliver tilgængelig."

